# .gitignore for the PRIVATE cross-machine mirror (branch: desktop-sync)
#
# Intent: sync *everything* between laptop and desktop EXCEPT secrets and the
# large, regenerable SQLite snapshot caches (GitHub rejects files > 100 MB and
# the app rebuilds these by scanning Kalshi). Unlike the public repo's
# .gitignore, this DOES include .claude/, .kss/, node_modules/, mockups,
# screenshots, logs, etc.

# --- Secrets / credentials (never publish) ---
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
.streamlit/secrets.toml

# --- Large / regenerable SQLite stores (rebuilt by the app; auth.db = creds) ---
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.pre-v*-backup
